{{DISPLAYTITLE: <span style="color: #ffa31a;">Wizard</span>}}
{{Protection}}{{MagicWords}}{{ClashofClansLink}}

{{Card Infobox|Cost=5|Rarity=Rare|Type=Troop|Arena=Spell Valley|ReleaseDate=4 January 2016}}{{SubpageNavBox|Evolution=yes|MergeTactics=yes|Hero=yes}}{{Quote|The most awesome man to ever set foot in the Arena, the Wizard will blow you away with his handsomeness... and/or fireballs.}}

The Wizard is a {{Rarity|Rare}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked from [[Arenas|Spell Valley (Arena 4)]]. It spawns an area-damage, air-targeting, medium-ranged, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with moderate hitpoints and high damage. He appears as a man who wears a team-colored cloak and pants, a dark brown shirt, wristbands, belt and boots, and have brown eyes, eyebrows, hair, and a goatee. A Wizard card costs 5 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

