==History==
2016
*The Wizard [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], decreased the Wizard's damage by 7%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], changed the Wizard so that he would no longer stop its attack if his target dies during the attack animation. It also decreased the Wizard's sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level cap to 11 (from 10). The update also fixed the "range bug", which decreased the Wizard's range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles), but his effective range is unchanged.
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], decreased the Wizard's attack time interval to 1.6 seconds (from 1.7 seconds).
*On 15/12/2016, the [[Version History#December 2016 Update (15/12/2016)|December 2016 Update]], decreased the Wizard's attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.6 seconds), but increased his first attack interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.2 seconds).
2017
*On 23/1/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/1/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Wizard's range to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles).
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], made a small change to the Wizard's card description.
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Wizard’s damage by 2% and his area radius to 1.5 tiles (from 1.2 tiles).
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
2019
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Wizard's card info screen.
2020
*On 7/7/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/7/2020)|Balance Update]], changed the Wizard's card render.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Wizard from Spell Valley to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 27/6/2022, the [[Version History#Summer%202022%20Update%20(27/6/2022)|Summer 2022 Update]], added the Assassin's Greed [[Card Mastery]] task for the Wizard.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Wizard from P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse to Spell Valley.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 6/5/2024, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/5/2024)|May 2024 Update]], added the Wizard's Evolution.
*On 6/8/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Wizard's hitpoints by 4.8%.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Wizard's hitpoints by 0.13%.

