==Trivia==
*The word "''Wizard''" comes from the Middle English "''wys''", meaning wise.
**In the German, Persian, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Wizard's name translates to "Magician". In the Chinese language settings of the game, the Wizard's name translates to "Mage".
*The Wizard is 1 of 19 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] which first existed in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Minions]], [[Archers]], [[Goblins]], [[Skeletons]], [[Barbarians]], [[Giant]], [[Valkyrie]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], [[Balloon]], [[Golem]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Bowler]], [[Cannon Cart]], [[Phoenix]], [[Lava Hound]], and the [[Archer Queen]].
**The Wizard resembles the Level 1-2 Wizard from Clash of Clans. His [[Star Points|Star Level 2 skin]] resembles the Level 10 Wizard in Clash of Clans. An opposing Wizard's Star Level 2 skin resembles the Level 11 Wizard in Clash of Clans.
*The Wizard is one of the first troop [[cards]] to be featured in a [[Training Camp|Trainer]]'s [[Battle Decks|deck]], alongside the Minions, Archers, [[Knight]], [[Spear Goblins]], Goblins, [[Bomber]], Skeletons, Barbarians, [[Minion Horde]], [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]], [[Musketeer]], Giant, Valkyrie, Hog Rider, [[Baby Dragon]], [[Skeleton Army]], Witch, P.E.K.K.A, [[Prince]], and Balloon.
*The Wizard is one of the first troop cards to receive a card render, alongside the Archers, Knight, Goblins, Bomber, Skeletons, Barbarians, [[Bats]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Rascals]], Musketeer, Giant, Valkyrie, [[Flying Machine]], Hog Rider, [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Zappies]], [[Elixir Golem]], Baby Dragon, Skeleton Army, Witch, P.E.K.K.A, Prince, Balloon, [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Goblin Giant]], [[Hunter]], [[Electro Dragon]], Wall Breakers, Bowler, Cannon Cart, [[Mega Knight]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Miner]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Ice Wizard]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Bandit]], Lava Hound, [[Night Witch]], and [[Fisherman]].
*Though not the first cards to receive balance changes, the Wizard is one of the first {{Rarity|Rare}} cards to ever receive balance changes since the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], the others are the [[Bomb Tower]], [[Inferno Tower]], [[Barbarian Hut]], and [[Elixir Collector]].
*The Wizard is 1 of 10 troops that has been featured under the [[Ruler Ability#Special Delivery|Special Delivery]] [[Ruler Ability|ruler ability]], the others being Knight, Skeleton Barrel, Mini P.E.K.K.A, Musketeer, P.E.K.K.A, Giant Skeleton, [[Golem]], [[Sparky]], and Royal Ghost.
*Unlike the [[Electro Wizard]] and Ice Wizard, the Wizard doesn't have spawn damage.
*His description is a reference to the Clash of Clans [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1gKcOhMRn7s Hype Man commercial].
*Occasionally when attacking and during his deployment time, the Wizard exclaims “''Magic!''”, “''Fire!''”, “''Showtime!''”, or “''Fireball!''”, references to the Clash of Clans [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6BsTLlR40kM Magic commercial].
**There is a [[Loading Screen Hints|Loading Screen Hint]] that says “''The Wizard can control all elements, except his hair''”. This is also a reference to the same commercial.
**The Wizard is 1 of 24 troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being Mini P.E.K.K.A., [[Mega Minion]], Hog Rider, P.E.K.K.A., [[Dark Prince]], Bowler, Ram Rider, Electro Wizard, [[Princess]], Ice Wizard, Magic Archer, [[Lumberjack]], [[Mother Witch]], Fisherman, [[Goblin Machine]], [[Super Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], [[Super Magic Archer]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Boss Bandit]], Archer Queen, [[Little Prince]], and the [[Terry]].
*The Wizard and Ice Wizard are revealed to be cousins according to the balance changes in the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]].
*The Wizard is featured in non-Clash games. More specifically: 
**The Wizard is featured as [https://brawlstars.fandom.com/wiki/Barley?file=Barley_Skin-Wizard.png a character skin for Barley] in Brawl Stars. It can be obtained by logging in to [[Supercell ID]]. A [https://brawlstars.fandom.com/wiki/Barley?file=Barley_Skin-Red_Wizard.png red version of this skin] is also available for Barley in Brawl Stars.
***There is a Loading Screen Hint that says "''There are tales of mechanical Wizard from a distant land''". This is a reference to these two character skins.
**The Wizard, along with the Goblins, Barbarians, Giant, Valkyrie, Hog Rider, Witch, P.E.K.K.A, and the Archer Queen, were featured as a non-playable opponent in [https://www.chess.com/ Chess].
**The Wizard, along with the Archer, Goblins, Barbarians, Hog Rider, [[Battle Healer]], Witch, Miner, Ice Wizard, and the Archer Queen, are featured as a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Characters character] in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
**While not available as a character, the Wizard's sounds, along with the [[Knight]], Barbarians, and Dark Prince, are featured in the [https://beatstar.fandom.com/wiki/Clash_Royale_Theme Clash Royale Theme] [https://beatstar.fandom.com/wiki/Songs song] in Beatstar.
*The Wizard, along with the Archers, Goblins, Barbarians, [[Ice Spirit]], Mini P.E.K.K.A, Musketeer, Giant, Hog Rider, Witch, Prince, and Night Witch, is featured as a sticker in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IMessage iMessage], in a sticker pack called [https://apps.apple.com/us/app/clash-theater-stickers/id1353823484 Clash Theater]. Also, along with the Archers, Goblins, Skeletons, Barbarians, Mini P.E.K.K.A, Musketeer, Witch, Prince, and Princess, he is also featured in the [https://apps.apple.com/us/app/clash-a-rama/id1182384664 Clash-A-Rama] sticker pack.
*In the Clash of Clans [https://youtu.be/vv8MI_y1Lsg Party Wizard Party Time commercial], the Wizard appears to have a pet bunny.
*The [[Card Mastery]] task "Assassin's Greed" is a reference to the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed Assassin's Creed] games series.
*The Wizard is the subject of a few [[Emotes]].
**The Wizard Disco Dance, Wizard Disco Balls, and the Wizard 67 Emotes resemble the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Party_Wizard Party Wizard] from Clash of Clans.
*Before the Wizard's card release, the Wizard's first attack interval was decreased to 0.2 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
*While Wizards in many fictions are said to be male, in Clash Universe, Wizard can be proven to be female too as there are two Wizards who are female, first is [https://clasharama.fandom.com/wiki/Katya Katya] from Clash-A-Rama and Second is [https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&source=web&rct=j&opi=89978449&url=https://clashmini.fandom.com/wiki/Storm_Wizard&ved=2ahUKEwjRzo7T1ImVAxVCs6gCHWhiGXgQFnoECA8QAQ&sqi=2&usg=AOvVaw3iqNg4F3g1IcGw7KbAFUp7 Storm Wizard] from Clash Mini. 

